   "label": "Apps",
   "kind": "folder",
   "children": [
    {
     "id": "apps/sitemapper-demo",
     "label": "sitemapper-demo",
     "kind": "app",
     "description": "SiteMapper Demo · The demo issue tracker as one application with two tiers. prod is the demo repository's issues (the standing issue #1 every acceptance run is pinned to); dev is the framework repository's own issues, the same UI over other data. The worked example for everything an app declares: the tier map, page-…",
